#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/0
msgid "I gave up my body... and my child... for my country."
msgstr "我为祖国舍弃了身体……和孩子……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/1
msgid "There is nothing left inside me now."
msgstr "如今我内心已空无一物。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/2
msgid "Thanks... thanks for listening to me."
msgstr "谢谢……谢谢你听我说。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/3
msgid "I feel... content. Snake..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/4
msgid "Commence the operation."
msgstr "开始行动。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/5
msgid "All that's left for you to take is my life."
msgstr "剩下的，你只需取走我的命。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/6
msgid "Let's make this the greatest 10 minutes of our lives, Jack."
msgstr "让这成为我们人生中最棒的10分钟吧，杰克。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2250 (id 0x259, record 186), budget 17 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2250/7
msgid "You're a soldier!"
msgstr "你是士兵！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x24b0 (id 0x146, record 186), budget 19 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x24b0/0
msgid "I hear it's amazing"
msgstr "听说很厉害"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x24b0 (id 0x146, record 186), budget 74 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x24b0/1
msgid "when the famous purple stuffed worm in flap-jaw space with the tuning fork"
msgstr "当著名的紫色填充虫在翻颚空间用音叉"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x24b0 (id 0x146, record 186), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x24b0/2
msgid "does a raw blink on Hara-kiri Rock."
msgstr "在切腹岩上做生眨眼。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x24b0 (id 0x146, record 186), budget 20 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x24b0/3
msgid "I need scissors! 61!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2600 (id 0x14c, record 186), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2600/0
msgid "Jack? I can't stop the transmission myself."
msgstr "杰克？我无法自己停止传输。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2600 (id 0x14c, record 186), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2600/1
msgid "Receiving that data and deciding how to retaliate is my mission."
msgstr "接收数据并决定如何报复是我的任务。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2600 (id 0x14c, record 186), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2600/2
msgid "The data itself originates from a separate device inside the platform."
msgstr "数据本身来自平台内的独立设备。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2750 (id 0x1a4, record 186), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2750/0
msgid "Retaliation may be my mission,"
msgstr "报复可能是我的任务，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2750 (id 0x1a4, record 186), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2750/1
msgid "but I don't want the world destroyed."
msgstr "但我不想世界被毁灭。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2750 (id 0x1a4, record 186), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2750/2
msgid "Transmission might stop if the power's cut off..."
msgstr "如果断电，传输可能会停止……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2750 (id 0x1a4, record 186), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2750/3
msgid "But I can't cut my own power,"
msgstr "但我不能断自己电，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2750 (id 0x1a4, record 186), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2750/4
msgid "any more than you can stop yourself from breathing."
msgstr "就像你无法停止呼吸一样。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2900 (id 0x17b, record 186), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2900/0
msgid "Submerging the platform in the lake might cut the power."
msgstr "把平台沉入湖中可能会断电。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2900 (id 0x17b, record 186), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2900/1
msgid "But my body won't do what it's told."
msgstr "但我的身体不听话。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2900 (id 0x17b, record 186), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2900/2
msgid "Reptile may have taken over the motion controls."
msgstr "爬虫类可能接管了运动控制。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2900 (id 0x17b, record 186), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2900/3
msgid "It's acting out of pure reflex."
msgstr "它只是纯粹反射动作。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2a80 (id 0x171, record 186), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2a80/0
msgid "The power should cut off if I cease to function."
msgstr "如果我停止运作，电源应该会切断。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2a80 (id 0x171, record 186), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2a80/1
msgid "But I can't guarantee it."
msgstr "但我不能保证。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2a80 (id 0x171, record 186), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2a80/2
msgid "Keep going. Destroy me."
msgstr "继续。摧毁我。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2a80 (id 0x171, record 186), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2a80/4
msgid "One must die, and one must live."
msgstr "一人得死，一人得活。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2eb0 (id 0x57, record 186), budget 20 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2eb0/0
msgid "Why'd you come back?"
msgstr "你为何回来？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c79f3cb block 0x2f10 (id 0x79, record 186), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c79f3cb/0x2f10/0
msgid "You'd better stay in line from now on."
msgstr "你最好从现在起守规矩。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xe0 (id 0x68, record 96), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xe0/0
msgid "Make sure you're not spotted."
msgstr "确保你没有被发现。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x150 (id 0x60, record 96), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x150/0
msgid "This is a Sneaking Mission."
msgstr "这是潜入任务。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x1b0 (id 0xc1, record 96), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x1b0/0
msgid ""
"Hide behind stuff,\n"
"take the long way around,"
msgstr "躲在掩体后，\n绕远路走，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x1b0 (id 0xc1, record 96), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x1b0/1
msgid ""
"whatever it takes to\n"
"stay out of sight."
msgstr "不惜一切\n避免被发现。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x280 (id 0x9e, record 96), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x280/0
msgid ""
"Your gun is a last resort. It could\n"
"just as easily kill you as save you."
msgstr "枪是最后手段。它救你\n也能轻易要你命。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x320 (id 0x4c, record 96), budget 14 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x320/0
msgid "Enemy spotted!"
msgstr "有敌人！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x370 (id 0x89, record 96), budget 75 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x370/0
msgid ""
"Keep your eye on what's left of your\n"
"LIFE gauge on the left of the screen."
msgstr "留意屏幕左侧\n生命值槽的剩余量。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x400 (id 0xc6, record 96), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x400/0
msgid ""
"To the right of that,\n"
"you'll see your Psyche Gauge."
msgstr "右边那个是\n你的精神槽。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x400 (id 0xc6, record 96), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x400/1
msgid "Exhausting it will inhibit your actions."
msgstr "耗尽会限制你的行动。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x4d0 (id 0x8d, record 96), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x4d0/0
msgid ""
"Your LIFE Gauge will recover with time.\n"
"The Psyche Gauge, too."
msgstr "生命值会随时间恢复。\n精神槽也是。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x560 (id 0xb4, record 96), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x560/0
msgid ""
"You'll recover faster crouching than\n"
"standing up."
msgstr "蹲下比站立\n恢复得更快。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x560 (id 0xb4, record 96), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x560/1
msgid "Lying flat works even better."
msgstr "趴平效果更好。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x620 (id 0x85, record 96), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x620/0
msgid ""
"Using a ration\n"
"will restore your LIFE Gauge."
msgstr "使用口粮\n可恢复生命值。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x6b0 (id 0x82, record 96), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x6b0/0
msgid "Press down on the D-pad to crouch."
msgstr "按下方向键下蹲。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x740 (id 0x6c, record 96), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x740/0
msgid "Press the A button to crouch."
msgstr "按 A 键下蹲。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x7b0 (id 0x8b, record 96), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x7b0/0
msgid "Hold down on the D-pad to lie flat."
msgstr "按住方向键下趴平。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x840 (id 0x74, record 96), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x840/0
msgid "Keep holding the A button to lie flat."
msgstr "按住 A 键趴平。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x8c0 (id 0x6c, record 96), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x8c0/0
msgid ""
"Unfortunately,\n"
"you can't crawl this time around."
msgstr "可惜这次\n你不能爬行。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x930 (id 0xee, record 96), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x930/0
msgid "Tilt <I=MOVE> a little bit to walk slowly."
msgstr "轻推 <I=MOVE> 慢步走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0x930 (id 0xee, record 96), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0x930/1
msgid ""
"Take it slow and cover ground\n"
"bit by bit to stay silent."
msgstr "放慢脚步\n一点点移动保持安静。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xa90 (id 0x6d, record 96), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xa90/0
msgid "Keep it down, Boss! They'll hear you!"
msgstr "小声点，BOSS！他们会听见！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xb00 (id 0xa8, record 96), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xb00/0
msgid ""
"The indicator in the\n"
"upper right serves as a compass,"
msgstr "右上角的\n指示器是罗盘，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xb00 (id 0xa8, record 96), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xb00/1
msgid "and shows sound sources."
msgstr "并显示声源。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xbb0 (id 0x68, record 96), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xbb0/0
msgid "Pay attention to your surroundings."
msgstr "注意周围环境。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xc20 (id 0x81, record 96), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xc20/0
msgid ""
"The percentage in the\n"
"upper right is your camo index."
msgstr "右上角的\n百分比是迷彩指数。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xcb0 (id 0x7b, record 96), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xcb0/0
msgid ""
"The lower the number,\n"
"the more easily you'll be spotted."
msgstr "数值越低，\n越容易被发现。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xd30 (id 0x92, record 96), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xd30/0
msgid ""
"Conspicuous movements and loud noises\n"
"will compromise your camo index."
msgstr "显眼的动作和噪音\n会降低你的迷彩指数。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xdd0 (id 0x62, record 96), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xdd0/0
msgid "Your fatigues will act as camouflage."
msgstr "你的迷彩服能当伪装用。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xe40 (id 0x83, record 96), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xe40/0
msgid ""
"To press up against a wall,\n"
"face it and hit <I=ACT>."
msgstr "贴墙站立，\n面向墙壁并按 <I=ACT>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xed0 (id 0xd1, record 96), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xed0/0
msgid ""
"From that position, you can do an Enemy Search\n"
"to detect enemies."
msgstr "在那个位置可以发动敌兵搜索\n来发现敌人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a720b block 0xed0 (id 0xd1, record 96), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a720b/0xed0/1
msgid "That also works while lying down."
msgstr "趴下时也同样有效。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x0 (id 0x7a, record 150), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x0/0
msgid "Chico's in one of these houses. You've got to find him, Snake."
msgstr "奇科就在这些房子里。你得找到他，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x80 (id 0x87, record 150), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x80/0
msgid "They've got Chico locked up in one of the houses here. Find him."
msgstr "他们把奇科关在这儿的某栋房子里。找到他。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x110 (id 0x90, record 150), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x110/0
msgid "To check inside a house, press <I=ACT> in front of the door."
msgstr "查看屋内，在门前按<I=ACT>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1a0 (id 0x90, record 150), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1a0/0
msgid "Check inside a house by pressing <I=ACT> in front of the door."
msgstr "在门前按<I=ACT>即可查看屋内。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x230 (id 0xbe, record 150), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x230/0
msgid "Supposedly the houses being used to hold prisoners"
msgstr "据说用来关押俘虏的房子"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x230 (id 0xbe, record 150), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x230/1
msgid "have been fitted with blue doors."
msgstr "都装了蓝色的门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x2f0 (id 0x72, record 150), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x2f0/0
msgid "Looks like the blue doors have peepholes in them."
msgstr "蓝门上好像有窥视孔。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x370 (id 0x78, record 150), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x370/0
msgid "I guess only the blue doors have peepholes in them."
msgstr "看来只有蓝门上有窥视孔。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x3f0 (id 0x5b, record 150), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x3f0/0
msgid "Check out the blue doors."
msgstr "去查看蓝门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x450 (id 0x8d, record 150), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x450/0
msgid "The blue doors have peepholes, you know...Try using them!"
msgstr "蓝门上有窥视孔……用用看！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x4e0 (id 0xde, record 150), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x4e0/0
msgid "To look through a peephole,"
msgstr "想透过窥视孔看，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x4e0 (id 0xde, record 150), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x4e0/1
msgid "get close to the door"
msgstr "靠近门"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x4e0 (id 0xde, record 150), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x4e0/2
msgid "and press <I=ACT> when the icon appears."
msgstr "图标出现时按<I=ACT>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x5c0 (id 0x76, record 150), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x5c0/0
msgid "Chico's around there somewhere! He's gotta be!"
msgstr "奇科就在那附近！一定在！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x640 (id 0xb2, record 150), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x640/0
msgid "Chico's in that house!"
msgstr "奇科在屋里！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x640 (id 0xb2, record 150), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x640/1
msgid "Go up to the door and press <I=ACT> when the icon appears!"
msgstr "走到门前，图标出现时按<I=ACT>！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x700 (id 0xcb, record 150), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x700/0
msgid "The confiscated houses have blue doors,"
msgstr "被征用的房子都是蓝门，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x700 (id 0xcb, record 150), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x700/1
msgid "with peepholes for keeping an eye on the prisoners."
msgstr "门上有窥视孔用来监视俘虏。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x7d0 (id 0x7f, record 150), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x7d0/0
msgid "The prisoners are being held inside the buildings with the blue doors."
msgstr "俘虏被关在蓝门的建筑里。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x850 (id 0x83, record 150), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x850/0
msgid "Look for the blue doors. Chico is behind one of them."
msgstr "找蓝门。奇科就在其中一扇后面。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x8e0 (id 0x7c, record 150), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x8e0/0
msgid "Peek inside the blue doors, Snake."
msgstr "往蓝门里看看，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x960 (id 0x9a, record 150), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x960/0
msgid "You can't go peeking into houses with the enemy on elevated alert."
msgstr "敌人高度警戒时不能偷看房屋。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xa00 (id 0x8e, record 150), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xa00/0
msgid "Forget about the houses for now. Wait for the alert to be lifted first."
msgstr "先别管房屋，等警戒解除再说。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xa90 (id 0xa5, record 150), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xa90/0
msgid "Please, Snake, be careful."
msgstr "SNAKE，请小心。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xa90 (id 0xa5, record 150), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xa90/1
msgid "Remember, Chico's life is at stake."
msgstr "记住，奇科性命攸关。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xb40 (id 0xba, record 150), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xb40/0
msgid "If they spot you, the enemy'll probably call in reinforcements."
msgstr "被发现的话，敌人多半会叫增援。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xb40 (id 0xba, record 150), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xb40/1
msgid "Make sure that doesn't happen."
msgstr "千万别让这事发生。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xc00 (id 0xfe, record 150), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xc00/0
msgid "Even if you take out the enemy at hand,"
msgstr "就算你干掉眼前的敌人，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xc00 (id 0xfe, record 150), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xc00/1
msgid "there's more where they came from."
msgstr "后面还有更多。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xc00 (id 0xfe, record 150), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xc00/2
msgid "I'd keep a low profile if I were you."
msgstr "我要是你就低调点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xd00 (id 0xa8, record 150), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xd00/0
msgid "Those alleys are a maze. You should be able to use them to sneak past."
msgstr "这些小巷像迷宫，可利用它们潜行。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xdb0 (id 0x87, record 150), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xdb0/0
msgid "Visibility isn't that good, so try not to bump into any hostiles."
msgstr "能见度不好，尽量别撞上敌人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xe40 (id 0xc5, record 150), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xe40/0
msgid "The train terminal is on the other side of the coffee factory."
msgstr "火车终点站在咖啡工厂另一侧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xe40 (id 0xc5, record 150), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xe40/1
msgid "Head for the factory first."
msgstr "先去工厂。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xf10 (id 0x77, record 150), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xf10/0
msgid "Start by making your way to the coffee factory."
msgstr "先前往咖啡工厂。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xf90 (id 0xc2, record 150), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xf90/0
msgid "To get to the coffee factory,"
msgstr "要去咖啡工厂，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0xf90 (id 0xc2, record 150), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0xf90/1
msgid "you'll first need to backtrack to the fork in the road."
msgstr "得先折返回岔路口。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1060 (id 0xc5, record 150), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1060/0
msgid "Remember that basin with the locomotive?"
msgstr "记得有机车的水池吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1060 (id 0xc5, record 150), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1060/1
msgid "Go through there, then head toward the coffee factory."
msgstr "穿过那里，再朝咖啡工厂走。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1130 (id 0xe6, record 150), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1130/0
msgid "There's a shortcut to the coffee factory nearby."
msgstr "附近有通往咖啡工厂的捷径。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1130 (id 0xe6, record 150), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1130/1
msgid "You might be able to use it if you work with your partner."
msgstr "和同伴配合也许能用上。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1220 (id 0x8c, record 150), budget 77 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1220/0
msgid "If you can't find a shortcut, go ahead and backtrack to the fork in the road."
msgstr "找不到捷径就折返回岔路口。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x12b0 (id 0xaf, record 150), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x12b0/0
msgid "The gate's on the northwest side of the prison camp."
msgstr "大门在战俘营西北侧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x12b0 (id 0xaf, record 150), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x12b0/1
msgid "Cut across the camp to get there."
msgstr "穿过营地就能到。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1360 (id 0x8e, record 150), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1360/0
msgid "If you cut across the prison camp, you'll find a gate leading north."
msgstr "穿过战俘营，会找到通往北边的大门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x13f0 (id 0xb7, record 150), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x13f0/0
msgid "There's a barricade in the northwest corner of the village."
msgstr "村子西北角有路障。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x13f0 (id 0xb7, record 150), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x13f0/1
msgid "You'll have to destroy it to go any further."
msgstr "想继续前进就得炸掉它。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x14b0 (id 0x74, record 150), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x14b0/0
msgid "The barricade is at the north end of the village."
msgstr "路障在村子北端。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1530 (id 0xad, record 150), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1530/0
msgid "To destroy the barricade, you'll need... What is it C4?"
msgstr "要炸掉路障，你需要……什么来着，C4？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1530 (id 0xad, record 150), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1530/1
msgid "Yeah, you'll need some C4."
msgstr "对，你需要一些C4。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x15e0 (id 0x91, record 150), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x15e0/0
msgid "Your objective lies beyond the gate. Use C4 to blast through."
msgstr "目标在门后。用C4炸开。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1680 (id 0xb2, record 150), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1680/0
msgid "You'll have to destroy the gate if you want to cross the bridge."
msgstr "想过桥就得炸掉那扇门。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1680 (id 0xb2, record 150), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1680/1
msgid "Some C4 should do the trick."
msgstr "用C4应该就行。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1740 (id 0x99, record 150), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1740/0
msgid "First, equip your C4. You can't plant a charge unless it's equipped."
msgstr "先装备C4。不装备就无法安放。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x17e0 (id 0xa4, record 150), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x17e0/0
msgid "To plant a C4 charge,"
msgstr "安放C4炸弹，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x17e0 (id 0xa4, record 150), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x17e0/1
msgid "hold down <I=AIM> and press <I=ATK>."
msgstr "按住<I=AIM>再按<I=ATK>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1890 (id 0xaf, record 150), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1890/0
msgid "Once the charge is planted,"
msgstr "安放好炸弹后，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1890 (id 0xaf, record 150), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1890/1
msgid "press <I=ATK> without aiming to detonate it."
msgstr "不瞄准按<I=ATK>引爆。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1940 (id 0x97, record 150), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1940/1
msgid "press <I=ATK> while aiming."
msgstr "瞄准时按<I=ATK>。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x19e0 (id 0xdb, record 150), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x19e0/0
msgid "To detonate a C4 charge,"
msgstr "要引爆C4炸弹，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x19e0 (id 0xdb, record 150), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x19e0/1
msgid ""
"keep the C4 equipped, then press <I=CQC>. \n"
"No need to aim."
msgstr "保持装备C4，然后按<I=CQC>。\n无需瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1ac0 (id 0x8d, record 150), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1ac0/0
msgid "Press <I=ATK> while aiming to plant an additional C4 charge."
msgstr "瞄准时按<I=ATK>可再安放一枚C4。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1b50 (id 0x8b, record 150), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1b50/0
msgid "To detonate the C4 charge, press <I=ATK>. No need to aim first."
msgstr "要引爆炸弹，按<I=ATK>。无需先瞄准。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1be0 (id 0x81, record 150), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1be0/0
msgid "C4 charges will detonate in the order that they were planted."
msgstr "C4炸弹会按安放顺序依次引爆。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1c70 (id 0xd4, record 150), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1c70/0
msgid "After planting a charge,"
msgstr "安放炸弹后，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1c70 (id 0xd4, record 150), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1c70/1
msgid ""
"press <I=ATK> again while\n"
"aiming to plant another C4 charge."
msgstr "瞄准时再按<I=ATK>\n可安放另一枚C4。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1d50 (id 0x88, record 150), budget 73 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1d50/0
msgid "It's not working. You're gonna need something with a little more power..."
msgstr "没用。你需要威力更大的东西……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1de0 (id 0x6e, record 150), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1de0/0
msgid "You need C4 to blow up that gate."
msgstr "炸开那扇门需要C4。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1e50 (id 0x7b, record 150), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1e50/0
msgid "That thing's not going to do any good. You gotta use C4."
msgstr "那东西没用。你得用C4。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1ed0 (id 0x52, record 150), budget 18 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1ed0/0
msgid "Use the C4, Snake."
msgstr "用C4，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1f30 (id 0x8a, record 150), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1f30/0
msgid "Destroying that gate will draw the enemy's attention. Remember that."
msgstr "炸门会引来敌人注意。记住这点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1fc0 (id 0xb9, record 150), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1fc0/0
msgid "Keep your eyes peeled."
msgstr "都给我盯紧了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x1fc0 (id 0xb9, record 150), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x1fc0/1
msgid "The enemy'll come running as soon as they hear the explosion."
msgstr "敌人听到爆炸声就会赶来。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x2080 (id 0x65, record 150), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x2080/0
msgid "C4 can be detonated remotely."
msgstr "C4可远程引爆。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x20f0 (id 0x6d, record 150), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x20f0/0
msgid "The barricade is located somewhere in that vicinity."
msgstr "路障就在那附近。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x2160 (id 0x63, record 150), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x2160/0
msgid "There, blow up that barricade!"
msgstr "就那儿，炸掉路障！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x21d0 (id 0x7f, record 150), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x21d0/0
msgid "See the barricade near you? That's what you have to destroy."
msgstr "看到你旁边的路障了吗？那就是你要摧毁的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x2250 (id 0x57, record 150), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x2250/0
msgid "That's the barricade, Snake."
msgstr "那就是路障，SNAKE。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x22b0 (id 0x5d, record 150), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c7a724b/0x22b0/0
msgid "The barricade is further west."
msgstr "路障在西边更远处。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c7a724b block 0x2310 (id 0x5e, record 150), budget 31 B
